Z||000004||mrfiero||03-20-2000||06:34 PM||||Unfortunately you will have a very difficult (probably impossible) time trying to locate an '88 tan leather manual shift knob.  That particular shade of tan was only produced in '88 and they have long since been discontinued from GM.  Any used ones that you might find will be in similar or worse shape than what you already have.<P>I know.....I own/have owned many '88 Fieros, all with tan interior.  '88 tan stuff is nearly impossible to find especially in good shape.  I have a tan leather shift knob that only has 75K or so miles on it and it's already turning black.  <P>I don't want to be the bearer of bad news, but it's one of those "been there, done that" kind of things.  I will keep my eyes open for you, but realistically I don't expect to find one.  Sorry.<P>LMK if you have any luck.||||reg||1
